[The Rover moves, probably because Charlie is changing tips on the            
penetrometer.]                                                                
                                                                              
[John takes a couple of steps backward as he seals the sample bag. This       
suggests a high level of confidence in his ability to move around this        
rock-strewn area.]                                                            
                                                                              
