[As the penetrometer sinks into the ground on Charlie's final push, he ends   
up balanced on his toes and his left hand, which is resting on the top of     
the drum. He tries to run uphill to get his feet under him but, after         
vigorously treading regolith for a few seconds, he gives up and falls         
forward onto his hands.]                                                      
                                                                              
144:35:51 Duke: Aghh, rats! (Pause)                                           
                                                                              
[Charlie pushes himself back and, once his torso is over his knees, he        
rises without difficulty.]                                                    
                                                                              
